name:Litaniae Sanctorum, Omnes sancti Patriarchae et Sancte Petre;
office-part:Supplicatio;
book:The Liber Usualis, 1961, p. 836; via GregoBase (gregobase.selapa.net), chant ids 8763 und 8762;
